msgstr "Exigidas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"fuse3\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gdk-pixbuf\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"json-glib\"/>, <xref linkend=\"pipewire\"/>, and <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dbus\"/> (at runtime).  Furthermore, a backend is"
" needed at runtime for this package to be of any use, such as <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-gtk\"/>, <xref role=\"nodep\" "
"linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-wlr\"/>, <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"xdg-"
"desktop-portal-gnome\"/>, and/or <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-"
"portal-lxqt\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"fuse3\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gdk-pixbuf\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"json-glib\"/>, <xref linkend=\"pipewire\"/> e <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dbus\"/> (em tempo de execução). Além disso, uma "
"estrutura de retaguarda é necessária em tempo de execução para esse pacote "
"ser de algum uso, como <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-"
"gtk\"/>, <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-wlr\"/>, <xref "
"role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-gnome\"/> e (ou) <xref "
"role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-lxqt\"/>"

