#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of xdg-desktop-portal"
msgstr "Instalação do xdg-desktop-portal"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>xdg-desktop-portal</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>xdg-desktop-portal</application> executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:138
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release -D tests=disabled .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release -D tests=disabled .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If the optional dependencies are installed, you can test the results by "
"running:"
msgstr ""
"Se as dependências opcionais estiverem instaladas, você consegue testar os "
"resultados executando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:149
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>meson configure -D tests=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja test</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>meson configure -D tests=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Without the external dependencies one test, integration/dynamiclauncher is "
"known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Sem as dependências externas, um teste, integration/dynamiclauncher, é "
"conhecido por falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:161
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Remove systemd files that are useless (as the &root; user):"
msgstr "Remova arquivos do systemd que são inúteis (como o(a) usante &root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -rvf /usr/lib/systemd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -rvf /usr/lib/systemd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D tests=disabled</parameter>: Prevents requiring several "
"optional dependencies that are only needed for tests."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D tests=disabled</parameter>: Evita exigir diversas dependências"
" opcionais que são necessárias somente para testes."

